  "label": "Anti-Latino/Hispanic Stereotypes",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that immigrants, particularly Latino or Hispanic individuals, are inherently criminal and violent. This is a widely disseminated and dangerous trope used to incite fear and prejudice against immigrants. The text explicitly links the victim's death to an 'illegal immigrant,' which is a direct invocation of this stereotype.",
